      <h1 class="jr-h1">Knee Cracking and Popping: Does It Mean Arthritis?</h1>
      <p class="jr-standfirst">Your knees crackle on the stairs, or grind when you squat, and somewhere online a page has told you it is cartilage wearing away. The research says something far less alarming — and it also says exactly which noises deserve an appointment.</p>

